<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada 91-day T-bill yields avg 3.958 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada 91-day T-bill yields avg 3.958 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada said the average yield at this week's auction of C$3.4 billion of 91-day Government of Canada treasury bills due December 12 was 3.958 percent, down from 4.087 percent last week.</p>
<p>The average yield on C$1.8 billion of 182-day T-bills due March 13, 1997 was 4.353 percent, down from 4.476 percent last week, and on C$1.2 billion of 357-day T-bills due September 4, 1997 was 4.853 percent, down from 4.932 percent.</p>
<p>The Bank bought C$1.0 billion three-month, C$150 million six-month and C$100 million one-year bills. It holds C$1.25 billion of C$7.6 billion bills due Sept 19.  </p>
